      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the node NIC to which the bridge is attached.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>address.ip</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Shows the default IPv4 and IPv6 IP addresses. Ensure that you set the masquerade IPv4 and IPv6 IP addresses of your network.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>auto-route-metric</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Set the parameter to <code>48</code> to ensure the <code>br-ex</code> default route always has the highest precedence (lowest metric). This configuration prevents routing conflicts with any other interfaces automatically configured by the <code>NetworkManager</code> service.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Next steps</strong></p>
